        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Ghostkeeper\n- Concepts: Windigo legend, Wendigo psychosis\n- Places: North America\n- Topics: culture-bound syndrome, cannibalism\n\nFacts:\n- The film Ghostkeeper has a plot inspired by the Windigo legend of North America.\n- The Windigo legend lends its name to Wendigo psychosis, a controversial modern medical term.\n- Psychiatrists have described Wendigo psychosis as a culture-bound syndrome.\n- Wendigo psychosis has been described as involving symptoms such as an intense craving for human flesh and a fear of becoming a cannibal.",
